Package: ggpalettes
Title: Curated Colour Palettes and Scales for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides curated, colour-blind-conscious palettes for scientific
    graphics, together with discrete and continuous colour and fill scales for
    'ggplot2'. Palettes can also be retrieved as hexadecimal colour vectors for
    use in base graphics and other visualization systems.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/YaoxiangLi/ggpalettes
BugReports: https://github.com/YaoxiangLi/ggpalettes/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    grDevices
